 961+ 0933              ; Guest RAM backing access
 962+ 0933              ;
 963+ 0933              ; Guest RAM allocation starts at NeoGS physical page 44h.
 964+ 0933              ; Guest byte address maps linearly to physical offset 110000h + guest address.
